      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "A warhead doesn\u0027t need a missile. Place it where you want the hole and light it with Flint and Steel, a Fire Charge or a redstone pulse. The fuse is 3 seconds plus 1 second per 3 blocks of blast radius, so a full Condensed warhead gives you 6 seconds to leave.\n\nBigger holes need Plastic Explosive, the one explosive part almost every warhead shares. The Assembler makes 4 at HV from 2 PTFE plates and 2 Industrial TNT. Make three, enough for a full Condensed warhead, and keep a lighter.\n\n[warn]Get well clear, and keep other charges away: another explosion sets a warhead off in half a second.[/warn]",
